  "Description":      "PS-Face Interpretation: gives the Face Personal Status from the Face Descriptors Object of a face (the HSEmotion probabilities, valence and arousal of the instance I02 of Entity Face Description). The interpretation is that of PAF-FPE: the most probable emotion of AffectNet is mapped to an Emotion of the vocabulary (Surprise to the Cognitive State Surprise), with its probability as Degree. A Face Descriptors Object of another format (an identity embedding) is refused.",

